### 1. Record a Clinical Consultation with Vitals (JSONB)
# @name recordConsultation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Patient presents with persistent severe frontal headaches and photo-sensitivity",
  "diagnosis": "Acute migraine without aura (ICD-10 G43.0)",
  "clinicalNotes": "Patient instructed to maintain headache diary. Prescribed Sumatriptan 50mg PRN. Follow-up in 2 weeks if symptoms persist.",
  "vitals": {
    "temperatureCelsius": 36.8,
    "systolicBp": 122,
    "diastolicBp": 78,
    "pulseRateBpm": 72,
    "respiratoryRate": 16,
    "oxygenSaturationPct": 99.0
  }
}

### 2. Get Consultation by ID
# Replace with UUID returned from POST
@consultationId = 31cad45a-92f4-47fb-82f1-88ae9e5278e9
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations/{{consultationId}}

### 3. Get Consultation by Appointment ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations/appointment/{{appointmentId}}

### 4. Get Consultations by Patient ID (Paginated history)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations?patientId={{patientId}}&page=0&size=10

### 5. Attempt Duplicate Consultation for Same Appointment (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "chiefComplaint": "Duplicate attempt",
  "diagnosis": "Should fail with conflict",
  "clinicalNotes": "Testing duplicate prevention",
  "vitals": null
}

### 6. Validation Failure Example (Should return 400 Bad Request with fieldErrors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": null,
  "patientId": null,
  "doctorId": null,
  "chiefComplaint": "",
  "diagnosis": ""
}
